00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:14.470
Six parties—eighteen individuals—
have passed the first test.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.360
2nd Party

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.360
Lawine

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.360
Frieren

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.360
Kanne

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.360
4th Party

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.360
Land

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.360
Fern

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.360
Übel

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.360
The second test will take place 
three days from now.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.370
8th Party

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.370
Scharf

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.370
Wirbel

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.370
Ehre

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.370
13th Party

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.370
Richter

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.370
Denken

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.370
Laufen

